-- (shared/calendar/cme.ts) was added to the expiry rules in
-- server/quant/universe/contracts.ts. Generated from the rule for every universe
-- futures root, 2010-2032, listing only the months whose dates changed, plus the
-- micro-copper (MHG) rule, which was missing. Updates of rows that do not exist
-- are no-ops; contracts ingested later are written with the corrected rule.
-- server/marketdata/contract-calendar.test.ts checks every line against the rule.

